Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.10,注释,,0,0,0,,翻译  1440kHz
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.41,0:00:01.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲浪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:01.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Surf's up
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿钥匙不在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have my keys
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where could they be?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  看来这个案子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, this looks like a job
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得交给绵尔摩斯和派生医生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for Spongelock Holmes and Dr. Patson
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到钥匙了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The keys are found
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么找的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.26,0:00:22.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,显而易见  我亲爱的派生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:22.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Elementary, my dear Patson
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.10,0:00:22.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:22.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Behold
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到钥匙的是你的黏屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Twas your sticky buns that found them
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是派大星是怎么变黏的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But how did Patrick get all sticky?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.21,0:00:30.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,耐人寻味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:30.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Intriguing
